  "sort": 100000,
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At the start of your turn, you can expend 1 Focus Point to fill yourself with elemental energy for 10 minutes or until you have the Incapacitated condition. While it lasts, you gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Reach.</strong> When you make an Unarmed Strike, your reach is 10 feet greater than normal, as elemental energy extends from you.</p><p><strong>Elemental Strikes.</strong> Whenever you hit with your Unarmed Strike, you can make it deal Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Thunder damage (your choice) instead of its normal type. When you do, you can also force the target to make a Strength saving throw; on a failure, you can move it up to 10 feet toward or away from you as elemental energy swirls around it.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-RLjMD2E277BxEwpH\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The Elemental Strike uses Dexterity: change it to Strength if it is higher. The push DC is your Monk DC.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
